## Gas Costs Reference

| Operation | Gas Cost |
|-----------|----------|
| SSTORE (cold, zero→nonzero) | 20,000 |
| SSTORE (cold, nonzero→nonzero) | 2,900 |
| SSTORE (warm) | 100 |
| SLOAD (cold) | 2,100 |
| SLOAD (warm) | 100 |
| CALL (cold) | 2,600 |
| CALL (warm) | 100 |
| MLOAD/MSTORE | 3 |
| ADD/SUB | 3 |
| MUL/DIV | 5 |
| KECCAK256 | 30 + 6/word |

