## Security vs Gas Trade-offs

⚠️ **Never sacrifice security for gas**

| Optimization | Risk | Recommendation |
|--------------|------|----------------|
| Removing checks | Missing validation | Keep all security checks |
| Unchecked math | Overflow | Only when provably safe |
| Assembly | Audit complexity | Document thoroughly |
| Reentrancy guards | Gas overhead | Always use for ETH transfers |
